# ⚡ TaskFlow

A minimalist, Any.do-inspired desktop task management application built with Python, PyQt6, and SQLite.

---

## ✨ Features
 📋 Task CRUD Create, update, filter, and complete tasks seamlessly.
 🌙 Any.do Aesthetic Toggle between sleek Light and Dark themes.
 🔔 Floating Toasts Unobtrusive popup reminders with built-in Snooze options.
 📌 System Tray Integration Runs quietly in the background near your system clock.
 ⚡ Global Hotkey Press `Ctrl + Shift + H` anywhere to quickly pop open a new task window.
 💾 AppData Persistence Stores task databases in `%LOCALAPPDATA%` so data stays safe across app updates.

---

## 🚀 Installation & Setup

### Option 1 Run Pre-compiled Executable (Windows)
1. Download `SmartHomeworkTracker.exe` from the [Releases](httpsgithub.comyourusernameTaskFlowreleases) tab.
2. Double-click to launch—no Python setup required.

### Option 2 Run from Source
```powershell
# Clone repo
git clone [httpsgithub.comyourusernameTaskFlow.git](httpsgithub.comyourusernameTaskFlow.git)
cd TaskFlow

# Install dependencies
pip install -r requirements.txt

# Run application
python main.py